WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,990
This quality seems much higher than the previous ones

2
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:10,970
There's something else here

3
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,660
We just searched

4
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,860
How can you still find it?

5
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,860
Old people like to hide things in inconspicuous places

6
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,260
Just browse a few more places and you'll have it.

7
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:24,060
Searched many times

8
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,460
Okay, just divide it directly

9
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:37,700
Aunt Zhou, take these warm ones.

10
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,660
You don’t want cotton backs and down jackets

11
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:42,910
It's okay. I have enough clothes.

12
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,510
Or leave it to those who need it more

13
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,250
Many of these boards are painted

14
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,650
It smells really strong when burned

15
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,650
Let’s keep it as fuel first

16
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:57,050
If necessary, we will deal with it. Everyone in the building will know.

17
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:58,650
Today each family will receive grain and planks of wood

18
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:00,650
These can be put on the bright side later

19
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,250
No need to explain the source
